    "title": "📑 Session 34 — Chapter 10: Serial Peripheral Interface (SPI) Peripheral in S32K144 MCU.|||📑 Buổi 34 — Chapter 10: Serial Peripheral Interface (SPI) Peripheral in S32K144 MCU.",
